OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday will be damp and grey
OL,6,Fwith drizzly spells, and foggy
OL,7,Finterludes mainly along exposed coasts
OL,8,Fand hills. There may be brighter
OL,9,Fbreaks, during the morning in the west
OL,10,Fand during the afternoon further east.
OL,11,FFeeling very mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FInterludes of clearer skies
OL,14,Fand drizzly spells will pass
OL,15,Fovernight. Heavy rain and strong winds
OL,16,Fwill reach the west and central areas
OL,17,Fby dawn. Feeling mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
