OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA wet and windy start as
OL,6,Fheavy rain sweeps eastwards. Despite
OL,7,Fthe sunny spells, the afternoon will
OL,8,Ffeel cooler than on Monday with a
OL,9,Ffresh, gusty breeze following the rain.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FOn
OL,12,FWednesday, dry sunny spells and winds
OL,13,Fstrengthening to a fresh breeze. Gusty
OL,14,Fwinds remain on Thursday, and a band
OL,15,Fof rain arrives later. A sunnier, more
OL,16,Fsettled Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
